:: Widget Manor Alarm [widget]

<<widget "manoralarm_text">>
	<<if $manorHeist.alarm gte 40>>
		<span class="red">Security are on high alert.</span>
        <br><br>
	<<elseif $manorHeist.alarm gte 20>>
		<span class="purple">Security are aware of an intruder.</span>
        <br><br>
	<<elseif $manorHeist.alarm gte 10>>
		<span class="lblue">Security are suspicious.</span>
        <br><br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">Security are relaxed.</span>
        <br><br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Search
<<effects>>
<<run delete $manorHeist.search>>

You stroll the streets, keeping an eye out for the address Landry gave you. It doesn't take long to find it, as it stands out quite a bit.
<br><br>

A large resplendent Manor resting on a small hill, you aren't even sure if you needed the address. You toss the paper in a bin as you examine the Manor from the roadside, your keen eyes noting the many entrances and exits. Most apparent to you is the crumbled bit of perimeter wall, hidden from view by a swath of trees.
<br><br>

You approach the portion of wall slowly, keeping an eye out for any sort of prevention method set up.The way is clear, and you arrive at the wall with little problem. The broken wall is much lower than the rest of the barrier, and you are able to reach the edge without much difficulty.
<br><br>

<<link [[Climb over the edge|Danube Manor Heist Climb]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Danube Manor Heist Leave]]>><<set $manorHeist.search to 1>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Climb
<<effects>>

You grasp the edge of the wall, pulling yourself up onto the edge before throwing your legs over the side and sliding off the side.

<<if $worn.feet.type.includes("heels") and $feetskill lte 400>>

    You hit the ground hard, feeling your heeled feet twist below you as you tumble to the ground painfully.<<pain 10>><<gpain>>
    <br><br>

<<else>>

    You land gracefully on the other side, crouching low to absorb the impact.
    <br><br>
<</if>>

<<set $danger to random(1, 10000)>>
<<if $danger gte (9900 - $allure)>>
    <<beastNEWinit 1 dog>>

        You stand up, brushing the dirt off of you, when you hear a bark. You look up just in time for the guard <<beasttype>> to collide with you, knocking you to the ground.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Dog]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>

    <<else>>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Climb 2]]>><</link>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Climb 2
<<effects>>
<<set $manorHeist.alarm to 1>>
<<manoralarm_text>>

Quickly scanning for cover, you sneak closer to a shrub you can hide behind. 
<br><br>

Scanning the Manor grounds, everything seems clear. You quickly cross the grounds, pressing your body against the side of the Manor as you peek carefully through the window. 
<br><br>

The coast seems clear, so you carefully open the window and slip inside, finding yourself standing in a spacious dining room.You seem to be alone, but you're not sure how long it will stay that way.
<br><br>

<<link [[Search the room|Danube Manor Heist Search In]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Explore the manor|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Search In
<<effects>>

<<if $rng gte 51>>

    You search the room for any valuable items, rifling through drawers as quietly as you can.
    <br><br>

    Despite your extensive searching, you fail to find anything worth taking.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>

    You search the room, searching quickly but quietly through the cabinet drawers. 
    <br><br>

    You find a collectible spoon. You figure it could be worth something.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Take it|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><<set $blackmoney += 15>><<crimeup 15>><</link>><<crime>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave it|Danube Manor Heist Search In Leave]]>><</link>>
	<br>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Search In Leave
<<effects>>

You leave the spoon. It would be cruel to ruin with their collection.

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Explore
<<effects>>
<<manoralarm_text>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

<<set $danger to random(1,10000)>>
<<if $danger gte 8000 - (50 * $manoralarm) and $eventskip is 0>>

    You step through the breezeway into the Great Hall. Before you can move, a servant appears. 
    <br><br>

    They calls out, "Hey, who are you?" You duck back into the Dining Room, hiding beneath the tablecloth of the table. Holding your breath, you wait as the footsteps draw closer. The servant mutters, "What the…" 
    <br><br>

    You hear they close the window you entered from. "Gotta report this to the Head…" The servant leaves the room. <<gsuspicion>>
    <br><br>

    With a sigh, you clamber out from beneath the table. You step into the Great Hall, now empty.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Manor Heist Danube Explore]]>><<set $manoralarm += 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

<<else>>

    <<if $manorHeist.treasure is 1>>

        <span class="lblue">You have what you came for. Time to leave.</span>
        <br><br>

    <</if>>

    You move to the breezeway leading to the great hall, carefully checking for any staff. The coast is clear, and you quickly step into the great hall.
    <br><br>

    <<if $manorHeist.treasure is 1>>

        <<if $manorHeist.alarm lte 30>>

            <<link [[Leave through the dining room|Danube Manor Heist Leave Dining]]>><</link>>
            <br>

        <</if>>

        <<link [[Leave through the main door|Danube Manor Heist Leave Main]]>><</link>>

    <<else>>

        <<if $manorHeist.upchecked isnot 1>>

            <<link [[Go upstairs|Danube Manor Heist Up]]>><</link>>
            <br>
            
        <<else>>

            <<link [[Go upstairs|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><</link>>
            <br>

        <</if>>

        <<if $manorHeist.kitchen isnot 1>>

            <<link [[Search the rest of the lower floor|Danube Manor Heist Lower]]>><</link>>

        
        <<else>>

            <<link [[Go to the lower floor|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><</link>>

        <</if>>

    <</if>>

<</if>>
:: Danube Manor Heist Lower
<<effects>>
<<manoralarm_text>>

You decide to search the rest of the lower floor. Making your way carefully between rooms, you head to the back of the Manor. You're walking down a hall near the Kitchens when you hear footsteps approaching.
<br><br>

<<link [[Hide|Danube Manor Heist Lower Hide]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Hide
<<effects>>

The steps fade, and you take a deep breath before stepping back out into the hall.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen
<<effects>>
<<generate1>><<person1>>
<<run delete $manorHeist.kitchen>>

<<set $danger to random(1,10000)>>
<<if $danger gte 8000 - (50 * $manorHeist.alarm) and $eventskip is 0>>

    You turn a corner, bumping directly into a servant. 
    <br><br>

    They fall to the floor, a platter of food crashing to the floor.<<gsuspicion>>
    <br><br>

    You run before <<he>> can get a good look at you.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><<endevent>><<set $manorHeist.alarm += 10>><</link>>

<<else>>

    You continue down the hallway until you reach an open doorway. Carefully peeking in, you discover that you are in the kitchen. The staff hurry around, flitting from appliance to appliance. You step into the kitchen carefully, ready to duck out of sight, but before you can move you are nearly bowled over. Turning around, you see an incredibly muscular <<personsimple>>.
    <br><br>

    Holding a massive cooking pot, <<he>> fix you with a firm stare. "Move."
    <br><br>

    You scurry out of the way as the <<personsimple>> flings open an oven door, throwing the pot inside and closing it firmly. Without a word <<personsimple>> turns and leaves.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

<</if>>


:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2
<<effects>>
<<manoralarm_text>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

<<set $danger to random(1,10000)>>
<<if $danger gte 8000 - (50 * $manoralarm) and $eventskip is 0>>

    A servant runs into the Kitchen and shouts as they spot you.<<gsuspicion>> 
    <br><br>

    You run around a workstation, ducking low as a chef steps over you with a platter of food. The servant attempts to follow you but runs into the chef, sending the platter flying and causing an uproar. You step outside of the kitchen as the head chef takes the servant by the scruff of the neck, shouting at them. 
    <br><br>

    The Head Chef then drags the cowed Butler out of the room through a side door. You slip back inside.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Manor Heist Danube Lower Kitchen 2]]>><<set $manoralarm += 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

<<else>>

    With no one apprehending you, you take a moment to observe your surroundings and plan your next move.
    <br><br>

    You don't dare try to steal under the watchful eye of the head chef. Looking around, you see a thick door that could only lead to the cellar.
    <br><br>

    <<if $manorHeist.treasure isnot 1>>

        <<link [[Enter the cellar|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar]]>><</link>>
        <br>

    <</if>>

    <<if $manorHeist.kitchen isnot 1>>

        <<link [[Go back the way you came|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><<set $manorHeist.kitchen to 1>><</link>>

    <<else>>

        <<link [[Go back the great hall|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><</link>>

    <</if>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar
<<effects>>

You wait for a moment of calm before quickly dashing towards the cellar door. No one seems to care that you are there, most likely assuming that you are related to some staff. With a quick step you open the cellar door enough to slip in and shut it behind you. You take a deep breath before descending down the stairs. 
<br><br>

At the bottom you emerge into a dimly lit room, illuminated only by a single hanging bulb. In the center of a room a small chest sits on a pedestal, mounted to the floor. Upon closer inspection, you see the chest itself has been bolted to the pedestal, preventing it from being removed.
<br><br>

You examine the latch, noting the extra thick lock that holds it shut. It's not like any lock you've seen before.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar 2]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar 2
<<effects>>
<<manoralarm_text>>

Whatever is inside must be valuable, or they wouldn't go through such lengths to protect it.
<br><br>

<<link [[Pick the lock|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Pick]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Smash the lock|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Smash]]>><</link>><<gsuspicion>>
<br>

<<if $manorHeist.cellarkey is 1>>

    <<link [[Use the key|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Key]]>><</link>>
    <br>
    
<</if>>

<<link [[Leave|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Pick
<<effects>>

<<set $lock to 1001>>
		<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
            This wasn't supposed to happen
			<br>
		<<else>>
			You take the lock in your hands, feeling the heft of it. 
            <br><br>
            
            With slow careful attempts you try to get the lock to open, <span class="red">but it remains stubbornly locked</span>. 
            <br><br>

            No matter which angle you try you can't seem to pick it. Frustrated, you let go of the lock.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar 2]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Smash
<<effects>>

You look around for something heavy to smash the lock. Hidden in the corner, you find a large marble sculpture. Taking it into your hands, you examine it closer. The bust is shaped like an arm, with a closed fist.
<br><br>

You return to the lock. Grasping the bust tightly, you raise it above your head and bring it down on the lock. The sound of the bust hitting the lock reverberates in the small room, but you raise it once more.
<br><br>

With a decisive strike you smash the lock once more, shattering the casing and knocking it to the floor. Before you can do anything, however, the entire podium begins to tilt. The impact of the bust must have knocked the mounting loose. With a resounding crash it falls to the floor. <<ggsuspicion>>
<<set $manorHeist.alarm += 30>>
<br><br>

You step around the toppled podium, bending over to see the contents of the now broken open box.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Safe]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Key
<<effects>>

You take the lock in your hands, feeling the heft of it. Inserting the Key, you turn it with a heavy "clunk."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Safe]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Lower Cellar Safe
<<effects>>

You peer into the box. 
<br><br>

<<switch random(1,4)>>

    <<case 1>>

        The inside is lined with velvet, and sitting in the middle of the box is a large, jewel encrusted phallic shaped object. The assortment of jewels are blindingly shiny. You quickly grab it, hastily leaving the room and re-entering the Kitchen.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><</link>>

    <<case 2>>

        The inside is lined with velvet, and sitting in the middle is a small black box. You reach inside and pull it out, opening it carefully. Nestled inside there is a golden ring with a large, shiny diamond mounted on top. 
        <br><br>

        Looking closely, you notice "For M" engraved on the side. You quickly pocket the ring, and hastily retreat back to the Kitchen.
        <br><br>
        
        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><</link>>

    <<case 3>>

        The inside is lined with velvet, and sitting inside is a large sheaf of paperwork. Taking it into your hands, you notice the elegant font at the top declaring "Deed of Conveyance."
        <br><br>
        
        Looking closer, you see that it is the deed to a patch of land somewhere you don't recognize. You carefully fold up the paper before swiftly exiting back towards the Kitchen.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><</link>>

    <<case 4>>

        The inside is lined with velvet, but nothing is inside. The box is completely empty. You stand up, empty-handed, and walk back to the Kitchen.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Lower Kitchen 2]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

<</switch>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up
<<effects>>
<<run delete $manorHeist.bedroomchecked>>
<<run delete $manorHeist.officechecked>>

You decide to explore the upper floor of the Manor. 
<br><br>

As you arrive at the top of the large staircase, you hear footsteps approaching. Looking around you duck into the closest room.You quickly scan your surroundings. 
<br><br>

It's a broom closet. Heart pounding, you stand by the door as you hear footsteps drawing closer. Through the door, you can hear muffled talking. 
<br><br>

"Inside...<span class="gold">valuable</span>... Master." Before you can hear the rest, the footsteps fade.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 2]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up 2
<<effects>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>

    You step out of the closet back onto the landing.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.upchecked to 1>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up 3
<<effects>>
<<manoralarm_text>>

<<set $danger to random(1,10000)>>
<<if $danger gte 9000 - (50 * $manorHeist.alarm) and $eventskip is 0>>

    A servant steps out of a room, yelping in surprise as they see you. They break into a run, coming towards you. Thinking quickly, you jump onto the bannister of the grand staircase and let gravity slide you down to the lower floor. That was fun!<<lstress>><<stress -10>>
    <br><br>

    You reach the bottom floor and hide out of sight of the top of the stairs. The servant stops at the top, looking for you. "Shit, lost them. Gotta tell the Head…"<<gsuspicion>>
    <br><br>

    Once the footsteps fade you make your way back upstairs.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.alarm += 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

<<elseif $danger gte 8000 - (50 * $manorHeist.alarm) and $eventskip is 0 and $manorHeist.alarm gte 20>>

    <<generate1>><<person1>>

    You walk past an unmarked door when it suddenly swings open. 
    <br><br>

    Locking eyes with a shocked servant holding bed sheets you start to run away when <<he>> suddenly grabs you by the arm. "Got you you little tramp!" He exclaims, throwing you to the floor. "Hey! I caught the thief!" <<He>> begins to shout. You need to act fast before more staff arrive.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Escape|Danube Manor Heist Up Escape]]>><<set $manorHeist.alarm += 20>><</link>><<ggsuspicion>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Beg and trick|Danube Manor Heist Up Beg]]>><<set $manorHeist.alarm += 10>><</link>><<gsuspicion>>
    <br>

    <<if $submissive lte 850>>

        <<link [[Shut them up|Danube Manor Heist Up Shut]]>><</link>><<defianttext>>

    <</if>>

<<else>>

    <<if $manorHeist.treasure is 1>>

        <span class="lblue">You have what you came for. Time to leave.</span>
        <br><br>

    <</if>>

    You're standing on the landing of the second floor. You can hear movement in the rooms around you, but you aren't sure where exactly it is coming from.
    <br><br>

    <<if $manorHeist.treasure is 1>>

        <<link [[Go downstairs|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><</link>>


    <<else>>

        <<if $manorHeist.bedroomchecked isnot 1>>

            <<link [[Check the Bedroom|Danube Manor Heist Up Room]]>><</link>>
            <br>

        <</if>>

        <<if $manorHeist.officechecked isnot 1>>

            <<link [[Check the Office|Danube Manor Heist Up Office]]>><</link>>
            <br>

        <</if>>

        <<if $manorHeist.drawingchecked isnot 1>>

            <<link [[Check the Drawing Room|Danube Manor Heist Up DrawRoom]]>><</link>>
            <br>

        <</if>>

        <<link [[Go downstairs|Danube Manor Heist Explore]]>><</link>>

    <</if>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Escape
<<effects>>

You stand, shaking off the servant attempts to grab you. Breaking into a full sprint, you make it around a corner. You hear the servant behind you shout directions to the other staff.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Beg
<<effects>>

<<if $submissive gte 1150>>

	"Please," you whimper, doing your best to look trite. "I-I'm lost and I need your help."
    
<<elseif $submissive lte 850>>

    "What's the big idea? You attacking lost people now?" you ask, trying your best to look offended.

<<else>>

    "I can't find my way out, can you help?" you ask, trying your best to look sincere.

<</if>>
<br><br>

The servant hesitates, unsure of how to respond. Taking advantage, you hook your foot behind <<his>> leg and sweep his feet out from beneath <<him>>. With a shout <<he>> falls down, landing hard on <<his>> rear. Thinking quick, you grab the bed sheets and throw them over <<him>> like a net. 
<br><br>

As <<he>> struggles to free himself you sprint away. You hear him tell the other staff that he doesn't know where you went.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Shut
<<effects>>

You rise to your feet quickly, startling the servant. 
<br><br>

Before he can shout again you step forward and plant a solid punch to his stomach. He bends over, clutching his abdomen and gasping for breath as you sprint away around a corner. You hear him struggle for breath, unable to give the other staff any info.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Room
<<effects>>
<<manoralarm_text>>

<<if $manorHeist.alarm gte 20>>

    You approach the door with the "Master Suite" plaque affixed to it. The handle refuses to turn in your hand. It's locked.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Pick the lock|Danube Manor Heist Up Pick]]>><<set $manorHeist.alarm += 10>><</link>><<gsuspicion>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Leave|Danube Manor Heist Up Room Leave]]>><</link>>

<<else>>

    You approach the door with the "Master Suite" plaque affixed to it. The handle turns in your hand. It's unlocked.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 2]]>><</link>> 
    <br>
    <<link [[Leave|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Room 2
<<effects>>
<<run delete $manorHeist.safecode>>

<<set $manorHeist.safecoderandom to random(1000,9999)>>

<<set $danger to random(1,10000)>>
<<if $danger gte 8000 - (50 * $manorHeist.alarm) and $eventskip is 0>>

    You open the door and start to step in when you hear a noise from within. Stepping back, you press yourself against the wall and listen in.
    <br><br>

    The servant inside continues to clean the room, unaware of your presence. "Have to remember the Masters code... <span class="gold">$manorHeist.safecoderandom</span>... Cannot forget…" The servant continues muttering as they finish cleaning. You hide behind the door as they leave, and slip in before the door closes. 
    <br><br>

    <span class="yellow">You now have the Bedroom safe code!</span>
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.safecode to 1>><</link>>

<<else>>

    You look around, shocked at the display of wealth. The floors are an intricate marbled pattern, and the walls seem to be made of gold. The bed sits squarely in the center of the room, the 4 posts adorned with delicate silk sheets. You rub the sheets between your fingers, feeling a sense of longing.
    <br><br>

    Bailey would never let you have such nice sheets. Turning from the sheets, you see a large desk made of a dark wood. Your keen eye recognizes it as mahogany.
    <br><br>

    Underneath it, however, is the main focus. A large safe sits snugly beneath the desk, bolted to the floor. You crouch down for a better view. The safe is sturdily built, with no obvious way to pry it open. You'd need a code.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 3]]>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Room 3
<<effects>>

You are stood in the Master Suite. Standing out to you is the mahogany desk and a stately dresser.
<br><br>

<<if $manorHeist.safecode isnot 1>>

    <<link [[Check the desk|Danube Manor Heist Up Room Desk]]>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Check the dresser|Danube Manor Heist Up Room Dress]]>><</link>>
    <br>

<</if>>

<<link [[Check the safe|Danube Manor Heist Up Room Safe]]>><</link>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Room Desk
<<effects>>

<<if $rng gte 51>>

    You rifle through the drawers in the desk, not finding much. Not even a fancy pen to nick.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 3]]>><</link>>

<<else>>

    You rifle through the drawers in the desk, not finding much.
    <br><br>

    As you are about to close the final drawer, however, you notice a yellow piece of paper you had missed before. 
    <br><br>

    Scribbled on it is "Safe Code: <span class="gold">$manorHeist.safecoderandom</span>." You place the paper back and close the drawer.
    <br><br>
    
    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.safecode to 1>><</link>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Room Dress
<<effects>>

<<if $rng gte 51>>

    You check the dresser, quickly rummaging through each drawer, but you come up empty. Not even a fancy tie to steal.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 3]]>><</link>>

<<else>>

    You check the dresser, quickly rummaging through each drawer, but you come up empty. 
    <br><br>

    As you search the last drawer you hear a crinkling noise. Pulling out a sock, you find a yellow piece of paper inside. Written on it is "Safe Code: <span class="gold">$manorHeist.safecoderandom</span>." You put the paper back into the sock and close the drawer.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room Safe]]>><<set $manorHeist.safecode to 1>><</link>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Room Safe
<<effects>>

<<if $manorHeist.safecode is 1>>

    You crouch beside the safe, and reach out to enter the code. Firmly punching the numbers in, you wait as the safe emits a series of clicks and beeps. 
    <br><br>

    Finally, with a solid *click* it opens slightly. You grasp the door and pull it back.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room Safe 2]]>><</link>>

<<else>>

    You crouch down next to the safe. Without the code, there isn't much you can do.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 3]]>><</link>>

<</if>>

:: Danube Manor Heist Up Room Safe 2
<<effects>>

You swing open the safe door and look inside. 
<br><br>

<<switch random(1,4)>>

    <<case 1>>

        Resting inside is a phallic shaped object, absolutely coated in precious gems. Even in the dim light underneath the desk it scatters the light in a dazzling array of colors. You pull it from the safe, closing the door. With a click, the lock reengages. Treasure in hand, you stand up and quickly leave the room.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.bedroomchecked to 1>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>

    <<case 2>>

        Sitting inside is a small black box, the glimmer of velvet unmistakable. You take the box in your hand, surprised at the weight. With a small click you open the clamshell style box, revealing a large diamond ring nestled inside. The golden band is half buried in the velvet, and a massive diamond has been mounted on it. 
        <br><br>

        Looking closely, you notice "For M" has been engraved on the band. Treasure in hand, you place the box back inside the safe and close the door. With quick steps you leave the room.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.bedroomchecked to 1>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>

    <<case 3>>

        Lying inside is a thick sheaf of paper, with "Deed Of Conveyance" emblazoned at the top in fancy script. Scanning the document, you realize it is the rights of ownership to a small patch of land. You don't recognize the address. With careful motions you fold up the paper and close the safe door. Standing, you make your way out of the Bedroom.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.bedroomchecked to 1>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>

