:: Danube Manor Heist Up Pick
<<effects>>

You crouch down, looking closer at the locking mechanism. 
<br><br>

Despite how fancy the Manor is, it's a simple lock. Maybe even simpler than you would find in a regular house. It takes no time to unlock, and you slip in quietly. 
<br><br>

You go to lock the door, but find no way to lock it. It must only lock with a key. <span class="red">They'll know you were here</span>.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up Room 2]]>><</link>>

