:: Danube Manor Heist Up Office Safe 2
<<effects>>

You open the small door to the wall safe. 
<br><br>

<<switch random(1,4)>>

    <<case 1>>

        Inside, a phallic object coated in jewels is resting. There are so many jewels you can't tell what material is underneath them. You grab the object, closing the wall safe door. With a low creaking noise, the painting begins to slide down the wall back into place. Treasure in hand, you leave the Office.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.officechecked to 1>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>

    <<case 2>>

        A small velvet box rests inside. Taking it into your hands, you open it. A golden ring rests inside, a massively fat diamond fixed to the top of the ring. You notice "For M" engraved on the side of the ring. You place the box back into the safe and close the door. Treasure in hand, you turn to leave as the painting slides down the wall.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Danube Manor Heist Up 3]]>><<set $manorHeist.officechecked to 1>><<set $manorHeist.treasure to 1>><<set $eventskip to 0>><</link>>

